ed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the morning and removed in the evening. The infant was also treated with casting in the m